Create one 1024x2048 portrait atlas, strict TWO COLUMNS by FOUR ROWS, eight equally sized 512x512 invisible cells, one entire mounted character group in each cell, large transparent gutters. EXACTLY eight poses, row-major order:
1 relaxed battle ready, both sabers low and horse standing;
2 locomotion A, horse near foreleg extended forward and opposite hind leg back, rider riding balanced;
3 locomotion B, opposite leg phase clearly changed, horse near foreleg lifted/folded back and opposite foreleg forward, no duplicate of pose2;
